Journey: ParaBank register, open an account and transfer funds
Tags: @parabank
Base URL: https://parabank.parasoft.com
Variables: password=Secret#2026

Set variable user to "ez" + randomString(8)
Open /parabank/register.htm
Type "Ada" into the First Name field
Type "Lovelace" into the Last Name field
Type "1 Analytical Street" into the Address field
Type "London" into the City field
Type "LDN" into the State field
Type "10115" into the Zip Code field
Type "5550100" into the Phone # field
Type "123-45-6789" into the SSN field
Type "${user}" into the Username field
Type "${password}" into the Password field
Type "${password}" into the Confirm field
Click the "Register" button
  Expect the page contains "Your account was created successfully. You are now logged in."
  Expect I see "Welcome ${user}"

Click the "Open New Account" link
  Expect the URL contains "/openaccount.htm"
Select "SAVINGS" from #type
Click the "Open New Account" button
  Expect the page contains "Account Opened!"
Capture the text of #newAccountId as newAccount

Click the "Transfer Funds" link
Type "25" into #amount
Select "${newAccount}" from #toAccountId
Click the "Transfer" button
  Expect the page contains "Transfer Complete!"
  Expect the page contains "$25.00 has been transferred"

Click the "Accounts Overview" link
  Expect the page contains "${newAccount}"
Click the "${newAccount}" link
  Expect the page contains "Account Details"
  Expect the page contains "Funds Transfer Received"

Click the "Log Out" link
  Expect the URL contains "index.htm"
